com/corporate/ENVIPO_11102026000432_Order.pdf"},{"symbol":"ABHAPOWER","ticker":"ABHAPOWER","company":"Abha Power and Steel Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 1.27 cr; ~2.9% of mcap (SME)","headline":"secures a **Rs 1.27 crore castings order from an unnamed railway OEM**, for supply by 31 October","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ABHA_11102026180722_ABHA_PRESS_RELEASE_SIGNED.pdf","mcap":42.4,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ABHA_11102026180722_ABHA_PRESS_RELEASE_SIGNED.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Envirotech Systems** — receives a **Rs 2.27 crore (incl. taxes) purchase order from Utkal Alumina International** to supply and install acoustic enclosures and curtains, shipping by January and installed by June 2027 _(~1.7% of mcap)_.","**Abha Power and Steel** — secures a **Rs 1.27 crore order from an unnamed railway OEM** for castings, due by 31 October, taking its order book to about Rs 19 crore _(~2.9% of mcap; SME)_."],"capex_core":["**S.J.S. Enterprises** — new subsidiary SJS Display Electronics sub-leases a build-to-suit 60,000 sq ft plant near Pune to enter cover glass and display electronics, investing **about Rs 81 crore** (Rs 65 crore machinery, Rs 16 crore leased building), operating by September 2027 _(~1.3% of mcap)_.","**S.J.S. Enterprises** — subsidiary Walter Pack will move its three Ranjangaon plants into one **1,27,359 sq ft facility** near Pune by May 2027, adding 63,086 sq ft, for **about Rs 49 crore** (Rs 34 crore of it a leased building)."],"business_updates":["**63 moons technologies** — subsidiary 63SATS Cybertech reports provisional **H1 FY27 billed revenue of Rs 218.21 crore** and a Rs 400 crore order book, and **raises FY27 guidance to Rs 600 crore from Rs 350 crore**.","**Power Grid Corporation of India** — completes commissioning of the Rajasthan REZ (20 GW) phase-III Part-C1 evacuation scheme, effective 22 September, with the commercial-operation notice received on 11 October.","**Baazar Style Retail** — opens a Style Baazar store at Raniganj, West Bengal, taking its **store count to 286**.","**P N Gadgil Jewellers** — opens its **81st store**, and fifth in Uttar Pradesh, at Ayodhya under the franchise-owned, company-operated model, and launches a Ramayana-inspired Ram Katha collection.","**PNGS Gargi Fashion Jewellery** — opens two exclusive brand stores on 11 October, at Pacific Mall, Jaipur and Elpro City Square Mall, Chinchwad, Pune.","**Dreamfolks Services** — launches DreamFolks Club Nagavalli Wilderness Estate, a members-only club of about 30 acres with a 25-acre golf course and 37 cottages on the Odisha-Andhra Pradesh border (investment not disclosed)."],"distress_risk":["**LS Industries** — SEBI revokes the restrictions it confirmed in May 2025 over an alleged manipulative scheme, but BSE has kept the shares suspended since December 2025 after finding no textile operations, and its proceedings continue.","**TeleCanor Global** — files its June-quarter results on 10 October, disclosing **Rs 11.62 crore of bank loans outstanding, all of it in default**, and calls its AGM for 31 October."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ENVIPO_11102026000432_Order.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ABHA_11102026180722_ABHA_PRESS_RELEASE_SIGNED.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null}],"capex_core":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SJS_11102026145244_Reg30SJSDisplayElectronicsNewManufacturingFacility.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SJS_11102026144505_Reg30WalterPackAutomotiveCapacityExpansion.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null